---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — OpenMac" description="Why OpenMac exists and who writes the reviews.">
  <h1 class="title">About OpenMac</h1>
  <div class="prose mt-6 max-w-2xl">
    <p>
      OpenMac is an independent, curated directory of open source software for the
      Apple ecosystem — Mac, iPhone, iPad, Watch, TV and Vision — with hands-on
      reviews written after real daily use, not after reading a changelog.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every listing is checked against three rules: a real open source license,
      something you can actually install, and signs of life within the last six
      months. Metadata (stars, latest release, licenses) is refreshed
      automatically, so a stale project never masquerades as a living one.
    </p>
    <p>
      Reviews follow a fixed template — install, first run, a stretch of daily
      use, and a verdict with a score — because opinions are only useful when you
      can see how they were formed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Free your Mac. It can do anything.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
